OL,3,GNEWSABalaclava boys on electric bikes:
OL,4,AHow to tackle the problem?
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom the Pentland Hills near Edinburgh
OL,7,Fto the streets of the country's biggest
OL,8,Fcities, a common menace is causing
OL,9,Firritation, alarm and in some cases
OL,10,Feven death.
OL,12,FThe sight of young men, their
OL,13,Fidentities hidden by black balaclavas,
OL,14,Ftearing around on electric bikes or
OL,15,Fscooters is becoming a familiar one.
OL,17,FThe picture above was taken by a man
OL,18,Fwho posted on social media about
OL,19,F"morons on electric bikes" scaring a
OL,20,Fnearby horse as they rode illegally on
OL,21,Fpublic footpaths.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
